{"namaHsvastisvahasvaDalanvasaqyogaca": [{"id": "namaHsvastisvAhAsvaDAlaMvazaqyogAcca", "headword": "नमःस्वस्तिस्वाहास्वधालंवषड्योगाच्च", "headword_slp1": "namaHsvastisvAhAsvaDAlaMvazaqyogAcca", "fold": "namaHsvastisvahasvaDalanvasaqyogaca", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "ashtadhyayi-english", "senses": [{"gloss": "The 4th case-affix is used in conjuction with the words नमः 'salutation', स्वस्ति 'peace', स्वाहा , स्वधा (terms used in offering oblations to Gods and पित्रि-s, respectively), अलम् , 'a match for', 'sufficient for' and वषट् , a term for oblation.\n\nTerms: विभक्ति-4", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["नमःस्वस्तिस्वाहास्वधालंवषड्योगाच्च २.३.१६", "२.३.१६", "२.३.१६ नमःस्वस्तिस्वाहास्वधालंवषड्योगाच्च"], "synonyms_slp1": ["namaHsvastisvAhAsvaDAlaMvazaqyogAcca २.३.१६", "२.३.१६", "२.३.१६ namaHsvastisvAhAsvaDAlaMvazaqyogAcca"]}], "namovarivascitraNaH kyac": [{"id": "namovarivaScitraNaH kyac", "headword": "नमोवरिवश्चित्रङः क्यच्", "headword_slp1": "namovarivaScitraNaH kyac", "fold": "namovarivascitraNaH kyac", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "ashtadhyayi-english", "senses": [{"gloss": "The affix in the sense of 'making', comes after these words, as the object of the action, viz. नमस् 'adoration', वरिवस् 'honour', चित्र 'wonder'.\n\nTerms: क्यच्", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["नमोवरिवश्चित्रङः क्यच् ३.१.१९", "३.१.१९", "३.१.१९ नमोवरिवश्चित्रङः क्यच्"], "synonyms_slp1": ["namovarivaScitraNaH kyac ३.१.१९", "३.१.१९", "३.१.१९ namovarivaScitraNaH kyac"]}], "namikampismyajasakamahinsadipo raH": [{"id": "namikampismyajasakamahiMsadIpo raH", "headword": "नमिकम्पिस्म्यजसकमहिंसदीपो रः", "headword_slp1": "namikampismyajasakamahiMsadIpo raH", "fold": "namikampismyajasakamahinsadipo raH", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "ashtadhyayi-english", "senses": [{"gloss": "The affix र comes in the sense of 'agent having such a habit etc.' after the verbs 1. नम 'to bow' 2. क्मप् 'to shake' 3. स्मि 'to smile' 4. अजस् 'not to cease' 5. कम 'to desire' 6. हिं